{%- comment -%}
  Per-section Purelane assets.

  Fonts and core tokens used to live here, emitted once per section so a section
  could stand alone. That duplication is what broke the cascade — see
  snippets/purelane-head.liquid for the full account. They now render once from
  layout/theme.liquid, which is the single line of Dawn this build touches.

  What is left is the reveal script. Duplicate <script src> tags for the same
  href are fetched once by the browser, and the script guards against double
  execution internally via window.__purelaneReveal, so emitting it per section
  is free and keeps each section self-contained for its behaviour.
{%- endcomment -%}

<script src="{{ 'purelane-reveal.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
